    {
      "text": "Nephi1 delights in scriptures, in things of the Lord, 2 Ne. 4:15–16 (11:2, 4–6; 25:5). devil delights in those who worship idols, 2 Ne. 9:37. my heart delights in righteousness, 2 Ne. 9:49. let your soul delight in fatness, 2 Ne. 9:51. Nephi1 delights in plainness, 2 Ne. 25:4 (31:3). Nephi1 delights to prophesy concerning Christ, 2 Ne. 25:13. God delights in chastity, Jacob 2:28. Moroni1 does not delight in bloodshed, Alma 48:11. Nephites delight in everything save that which is good, Moro. 9:19.",
